@page 0.2
  title YamiNet Arcade
= Prism Breakout
Clear the prism wall. Keep the ball alive. Chase 500 points.
> game:prism | Prism Breakout
Use Left / Right or A / D to move, Space to start and launch, P to pause.
The game starts only when you choose Play. No installation is needed.

= Lantern Drift
Guide a lantern through a moonlit marsh. Gather 24 lights and avoid the moths.
> game:lantern | Lantern Drift
WASD / arrows or hold the mouse to steer. Space / Z gathers nearby lights. X / right click mutes.
